      "result": "{\"success\":true,\"mana_cost\":\"{1}{W}\",\"name\":\"Voice of Victory\",\"rules\":[\"Mobilize 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, create two tapped and attacking 1/1 red Warrior creature tokens. Sacrifice them at the beginning of the next end step.)\",\"Your opponents can\\u0027t cast spells during your turn.\"],\"power\":\"1\",\"type\":\"Creature  - Human Bard\",\"toughness\":\"3\"}",
